raphraser_tone_animation_text[0]","Your brain uses more energy when you're asleep than when you're awake")},{runName:"DescriptionInformative",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[0]","Your brain uses more energy when you're asleep than when you're awake")},{runName:"DescriptionCustom",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[1]","Even in rest, your brain is hard at work—proof that growth and healing happen when you pause")},{runName:"DescriptionPersuasive",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[2]","Think sleep is lazy time? Think again—your brain uses more energy at night, so quality rest is essential for top performance")},{runName:"DescriptionProfessional",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[3]","Neurological studies indicate that the brain’s energy expenditure increases during sleep, primarily due to critical cognitive and physiological processes")},{runName:"DescriptionInspirational",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[1]","Even in rest, your brain is hard at work—proof that growth and healing happen when you pause")},{runName:"DescriptionCasual",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[4]","Weird but true — your brain works harder when you’re asleep than when you’re awake!")},{runName:"Neutral1",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[5]","Neutral")},{runName:"Neutral2",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[5]","Neutral")},{runName:"Casual1",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[6]","Casual")},{runName:"Casual2",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[6]","Casual")},{runName:"Informative1",text:e("feature_unlock.paraphraser_tone_animation_text[7]","Informative")},{runName:"Informative2",text:e("feature_unlock.detector_highlights_animation_text[7]","Informative")},{runName:"Custom",text:e("feature_unlock.detector_highlights_animation_text[8]","Custom")},{runName:"Persuasive",text:e("feature_unlock.de